/**
 * Order owns the order aggregate, its status timeline, refunds bookkeeping and group orders, and
 * orchestrates the checkout saga as a Temporal workflow (see proto/README.md). Publishes
 * kade.order.events. Consumes kade.merchant.events (kitchen decisions → workflow signals),
 * kade.delivery.events (rider assigned / picked up / delivered) and kade.payment.events.
 *
 * State machine (OrderStatus):
 *
 *   PENDING ──saga ok──▶ PLACED ─(accept)▶ ACCEPTED ─▶ PREPARING ─▶ READY ─┬─(rider)──▶ PICKED_UP ─▶ DELIVERED
 *      │      └─future─▶ SCHEDULED ─(kitchen start time)─▶ PLACED          └─(pickup)─▶ COLLECTED
 *      └─saga failed─▶ FAILED
 *   PLACED ─(reject or 3-min timeout)▶ REJECTED
 *   SCHEDULED, PLACED ─(customer)▶ CANCELLED;  any non-final ─(ops)▶ CANCELLED
 *
 * Delivery orders may skip READY (rider picks up straight from PREPARING). Final: DELIVERED, COLLECTED,
 * CANCELLED, REJECTED, FAILED.
 */
